# Claude Code state.
# Project content — rules, skills, shared hooks, output styles, and the
# committed settings.json that references them — is tracked. Per-operator
# state (permissions, release notes) is not.
.claude-session-lock

# The operator's own agent setup, and not this project's business. It lives on
# each machine and is backed up in the private claude-setup repository. A public
# repository publishes a tool, not the way one person happens to drive it.
.claude/
AGENTS.md
CLAUDE.md
VIBE.md
.playwright-mcp/
